WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.470
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.420
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.820
STAR☆ANIS, a unit formed from Tristar, a unit currently advertising all across Asia,

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.530
and us, Soleil, will be limited to a single summer of activity.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.970
The higher your expectations of us rise,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.160
the hotter we will burn!

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.390
I'm the academy's headmistress, Mitsuishi.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.420
I have one more important announcement as well.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.290
The girls you see here, Arisugawa Otome, Kitaouji Sakura, and Kamiya Shion,

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.680
have formed the independent unit Powa Powa Puririn.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:40.520
These three will also be joining STAR☆ANIS.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.980
Please give us a few words on how it feels to be the newest members of STAR☆ANIS.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.040
Otome just didn't know what to do.

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:56.590
I couldn't decide whether I'd be able to balance both Powa Powa Puririn and STAR☆ANIS together.

00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:01.200
Well, there's a rumor that Powa Powa Puririn doesn't actually do any real activities...

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.600
But you know, once I realized that I'd be able to spread love to everybody on the Summer Tour,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.690
I decided to try my best at both!

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:10.000
Right, Sakura-tan?

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.630
Yes. I will give my utmost for this incredibly rare chance to work with my role models.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.940
And one more thing!

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:20.140
Shion-tan has an announcement of her own!

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:24.470
In order to focus on my acting career, I, Kamiya Shion,

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:26.140
will not be joining STAR☆ANIS.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.650
Then what about Powa Powa Puririn?

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.650
About that...

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.870
She won't quit!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.400
As the leader, I'm the one that convinced her.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.820
There you have it.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.410
I'm still not sure what that entails, though...

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:45.340
The STAR☆ANIS Tour is almost upon us.

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:51.420
This summer, STAR☆ANIS will deliver Love You to all of Japan!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.570
Now then, let's decide what to bring.

00:03:38.520 --> 00:03:41.920
Just in case our bus gets stranded up in the mountains,

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.610
let's bring emergency rations.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.620
Rejected.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.680
Just in case someone messes up our hotel reservation,

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.620
sleeping bags.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:52.870
Rejected.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:59.880
Just in case we get the worst horoscope prediction of the day, lucky charms.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.380
Rejected.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:06.390
Just in case a ghost comes to haunt us, a ward against evil spirits.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.510
You're fine with that?

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:16.060
Y-You never know what might pop up.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.110
That's enough. Let's just get to packing it all up.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:26.820
Those clouds look dangerous.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:30.970
Yeah, the news said that a typhoon might be approaching.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.210
I hope it doesn't ruin the tour schedule.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.710
Don't worry!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.830
I made us a teru teru bozu! {it's an established thing so we don't get to ou the ou... like how it's not Oosaka}

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:40.840
Huge!

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.720
Seeing one this big makes me feel like it might actually work.

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.810
Yep! I bet tomorrow's weather will be perfect now.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.720
Ichigo-tan!

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.230
Otome-chan, Sakura-chan!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.790
Morning!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:55.930
Good morning.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.730
Love you!

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.980
Sakura, that bag...

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.230
I've heard that you should always expect the unexpected.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.490
I packed everything that seemed as though it might be useful.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.020
That's right! I know exactly how you feel.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.450
So Sakura's in the Aoi school too... {eh, fine}

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.960
Good morning, everyhoney!

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.000
That's everyone.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:23.010
Let's go to the tour, yeah!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.800
My heart's starting to pound!

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.010
Me too.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.810
Headmistress, where are Mizuki-sama and the others?

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.270
Tristar will meet you there.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:34.020
You'll all do the rehearsal together.

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.550
Ichigo-tan, want some Pop'n Popcorn?

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.780
Sure, thanks a bunch!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.900
What are you going to do with that picture? {I don't really like What're}

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:45.860
I'm gonna upload it to KiraKiratter later tonight.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.410
Is that okay, Ichigo?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.910
Sure, go for it!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.930
Your fans feel closer to you when they see pictures of you offstage.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.160
Good idea.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:58.290
I want everyone to see how STAR☆ANIS is behind the scenes.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.800
Kiriya, I'm putting you in charge of publicity for STAR☆ANIS.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.170
Put up as many of those pictures as you can during this tour.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:11.180
Roger! Kiriya Aoi, now on duty to broadcast the natural charms of STAR☆ANIS!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.730
It's so huge!

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:52.600
It's really overwhelming actually standing up here.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.470
This is the best!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.100
Aoi?

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.800
It's still hard to believe.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:02.610
I'm going to be on stage beside the one and only Mizuki-san...

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.160
Tristar is in the house! {building}

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.080
Let's have some fun.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.410
We'll be in your care, Mizuki-san.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.870
P-Please watch over us!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.930
You two don't need to be so formal.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:25.090
We're STAR☆ANIS.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.880
Not a single one of us is better than any other.

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:33.150
This may be just a rehearsal, but it's our first time together on stage as STAR☆ANIS.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.150
Let's practice like there's no tomorrow!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.160
Right!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.770
That's it for the rehearsal. Good work!

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:49.050
Thank you for your support!

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.900
Looks like everyone's been taking their lessons seriously.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.910
Kitaouji, you're worrying too much about everyone else.

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:59.040
There's no reason to hold yourself back just because we're older than you.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:07:59.660
Okay!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.780
Same to you, Kiriya.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.920
Your movements got stiff every time you got close to me.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.110
Dance freely, with all of your heart.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.920
Got it! I'll sing and dance my heart out tomorrow.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:12.930
That's more like it.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:14.700
Mizuki, it's time to go.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:15.430
Coming!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:20.660
Mizuki-san gave me personal tips...

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.640
Does she have more work to do after this?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:27.300
She's doing separate promotional work for this tour with every TV channel.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.320
Everyhoney.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.110
All the preparations for tomorrow's show have been finished.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:37.320
Make sure you get some rest tonight so you can give your all during the show tomorrow.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.680
Yes!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.490
I wonder if the weather'll hold up tomorrow.

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:50.840
Yeah, I heard the staff talking about how the typhoon will probably affect us. {You had Kaede not contracting her "will" and Aoi contracting hers...}

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:54.340
In the worst case, it might hit us head-on.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.450
Wow, we're staying <i>here</i>?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.840
It has a calming feel about it.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:06.850
But why a Japanese inn?

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.360
The typhoon is steadily gaining strength.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:14.070
There is a possibility that it will make landfall tomorrow morning.

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:18.340
Wow, so this is a Japanese hurricane?

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:21.260
The nerve of that thing. It's four hundred—

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:24.120
no, four hundred and fifty years too young to mess with Yurika-sama. {I actually like this non-English construction. It's kind of like "it can't be helped".}

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.120
So good!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.690
That's my Ichigo-tan!

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.090
Yes! There's no use worrying about it.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.380
That's right.

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:41.690
All we can do now is have a good meal in preparation for tomorrow.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:42.640
Yeah.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.290
Ran-sama, is something the matter?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.550
Ah, no, it's nothing.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:59.410
I know you're just bad at taking the bones out of fish.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.190
Hey, Aoi!

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:02.670
So that was the case.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:06.820
Then please allow me to do that for you.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:08.040
I-I'm fine!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.040
Sakura-chan, try feeding her while you're at it.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.050
Aoi!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.140
Forgive me!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:25.780
I checked the news again, and they said that the typhoon might miss us after all.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.200
That's wonderful.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.960
So you should relax a bit more, okay?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:30.810
Understood.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:34.190
That's all well and good, but they seem to be relaxing a bit <i>too</i> much.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.190
Ichigo-tan, can you really stretch that far?

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.910
Almost there!

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:37.440
Hey girls, I heard that when you stay at an inn like this, {hey look it's an alpha effect}

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.200
everyone throws tuna around, right? {I don't think it's worth it, just TL note it}

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.790
Are you talking about pillow fights?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.860
Pillow? You can use them for that?

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.580
Wow! That sounds like a ton of fun!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.500
Aye! And we have a bunch of them lying around already.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.710
Hey!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:58.590
If you keep making noise like that, you'll awaken Yurika-sama from her deep slumber!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.500
This feels quite like a school trip.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.600
Ready, go!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.570
Mizuki-san?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.670
What are you doing standing out here?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:19.810
Well...

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.520
We've been waiting for you, Mizuki.

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:25.130
Don't just wait around, come in and play with us.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.540
Right... it's just that you all seemed to be having so much fun

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.330
that I wasn't sure when would be a good time to come in.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.730
Huh, what is it?

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.840
Did I say something strange?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.890
Love you!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.120
Yeah, love you.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.850
I see, well done.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.350
Is Mizuki in their room?

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:51.850
Yes. I haven't seen Mizuki that nervous since her debut.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:55.700
I was really quite surprised when Mizuki told me

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.900
she wanted to stay in the same room as everyone else.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.370
So was I.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.910
I'm sure that, as the leader, she wanted to strengthen the group's bonds.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.160
No—

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:10.910
Mizuki probably wanted to have some time to relax and have fun with everyone else.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.170
Sounds right.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.880
Next up, the latest updates on the typhoon.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:22.930
The meteorologists have informed us that the typhoon has changed course towards Kanto. {same deal as teru teru bozu}

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.540
You're awake as well, Ichigo-sama?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.690
Same to you, Sakura-chan.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.550
I'm just so excited.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:04.550
What? Excited?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.990
Yeah. I mean, we're finally meeting our fans.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:11.620
I bet that none of them can sleep either.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:15.060
Let's live up to their expectations and put on the best show we can.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:17.560
Ichigo-sama...

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.880
Otome can't control the feelings welling up inside her either.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.980
Let's talk more until everyone falls asleep.

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.070
Sure.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:31.030
Tomorrow's the all-important opening day of our tour.

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.880
Don't go pulling an all-nighter.

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.350
Okay.

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.230
So you couldn't sleep either, Ran.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:37.100
Yeah.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:40.600
I'm gonna go move around a bit.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.590
I'll come too.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.970
Aikatsu, Aikatsu.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.820
Sorry for dragging you out here too.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:04.360
Don't worry, this is calming me down too.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.110
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.200
Yeah.

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.830
One, two, three!

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:15.850
They're gone!

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:16.870
Amazing!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:22.380
I hope I can show my magic off to all my fans one day too.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:29.390
Calm your heart, Sakura.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.890
Everything is to show your fans the best performance you can.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.390
All of our feelings, and all of our fans' feelings...

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.430
Please let the stars hear our wish... {she's a vampire... that's like... really not God-y}

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:43.430
So you're so excited you can't sleep either, Yurika-chan.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.760
I-I was just on the hunt for fresh blood!

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.790
If you don't want to be my next victim—

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:52.360
If you can't sleep, then come hang out with us.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:53.950
Hey, don't ignore what I'm—

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.760
If only it were already tomorrow.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:58.440
I can't wait for our concert! {only because consistency, since I don't typically mind using "live" in English like this}

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.980
Yay, it's a bright and shiny new day!

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.030
Maybe that teru teru bozu of yours actually did something.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:18.730
Yeah!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.070
All that's left is to put everything we've got on stage.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:23.860
Right.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:34.370
Everything's good to go!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.370
Girls, our STAR☆ANIS dresses are here.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.780
They're all covered in glittery stars!

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.870
Each one's design is a bit different,

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.640
but they look like a single coord when they're put together.

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.380
Yeah, and STAR☆ANIS's symbol is really cool too!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.390
Girls, are you ready to shine?

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:00.890
Yes!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.780
Huh, what?

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:07.100
Is it part of the show?

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.430
I think it's a blackout.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:09.690
No way...

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.700
Huh? What's going on?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.450
It's a blackout! The entire stadium has lost power.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.840
Oh my god! No more power!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:22.670
That means we can't use the Aikatsu system either!

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.460
Give me the situation.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.590
Will everything be okay? We can still go on, right?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.840
As long as we can get a generator.

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:33.030
Everyone was so looking forward to today.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.840
We can't let them down like this.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:39.130
Yes... yes, I understand.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.240
I'm sorry for disturbing you at a time like this.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.610
Is there any chance of fixing it?

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.130
They're not sure.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.520
I see.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:51.530
If we can't at least get the Aikatsu system back up, 
then we'll have no choice but to cancel the concert.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.130
No...

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.280
Please wait!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:57.860
If there's even the slightest chance of fixing it, then I don't want to give up.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.030
Please.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.140
Ichigo...

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.310
Please help us.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:04.040
Please give us the chance to go on stage.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:05.350
But...

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:09.540
STAR☆ANIS!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:20.560
Headmistress.

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.560
Let's do this.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.560
Mizuki-san!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.560
We can't keep our fans waiting, can we?

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:28.560
Right!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.090
So now that we're actually here...

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.070
What should we do?

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.320
Kitaouji.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.830
Yes, I've got it right here.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:47.080
Thanks for waiting! We now bring you STAR☆ANIS's special stage!

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:50.840
You're up first, Arisugawa, Kaede.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:56.090
It's time for Arisugawa Otome and Ichinose Kaede's magic show!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:06.100
Kaede-tan's magic is Love You!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:08.510
Kitaouji's flower arrangement.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.870
Ran's perfected stage walking.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.170
Hoshimiya and Yurika, act the way you always do.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:21.630
Greetings, everyone. Now who here wants Yurika-sama to suck their blood?

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:24.750
Everyone! Thanks for coming to see us today!

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:25.750
Ouch!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:31.100
Hey! You must really want to get your blood sucked, stepping on a vampire's foot like that!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:34.770
I'll do my best to bring you the best concert of your lives!

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:36.710
Don't ignore me!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.250
Now for the Idol Professor, Kiriya.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:43.100
Let's begin the very first Mizuki-chan quiz! {bowl?}

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.420
First question: what is Mizuki-chan's favorite food?

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:49.140
Marron glace of course.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:52.650
How are they supposed to beat <i>you</i>, Mizuki-chan?!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.650
<i>Mizuki-san really is amazing.</i>

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:00.160
<i>She sees all of our individual personalities,</i>

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.780
<i>and uses them to make our fans this happy.</i>

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.430
Yeah!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:20.300
This is exactly why I said you couldn't look away for a second.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.160
Let's burn brightly tonight!

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:25.310
STAR☆ANIS...

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.810
Start!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.440
That was an amazing concert, everyone.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.500
It's all thanks to you, Mizuki-san.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:41.210
I was just caught up in my feelings and didn't know what to do.

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:44.150
No, those feelings are the most important part.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:49.400
The reason we were able to overcome this unexpected hurdle and make the concert a success

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:52.290
was because everyone's feelings towards our fans brought us together. {became one}

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.020
Mizuki-san...

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.530
The North Star, shining brightly in the sky,

00:21:57.530 --> 00:22:01.460
is only that radiant because it's made up of three stars overlapping to become one. {except one of them is way brighter than the other two}

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.460
Three stars...

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.650
If we can also combine our radiance,

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:08.840
we can shine as brightly as any star in the sky.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:12.470
The name of this summer's most brightly shining star will be STAR☆ANIS.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:16.480
Alright! Let's give it our all until the very end of this summer tour!

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.530
Yeah!

00:23:55.560 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:02.110
In America, we call typhoons "hurricanes".

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:04.300
Even though it's a typhoon?

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:06.990
They're called different names 
depending on where they start.

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.920
A troubling typhoon.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:12.340
STAR☆ANIS is the best!

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:13.600
I want to continue this forever!

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:15.430
Huh? When'd we go out to sea?

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:18.350
Prepare yourselves, STAR☆ANIS.

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:19.680
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:21.520
Finale on board.

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:26.090
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
